              "My favorite part is ___.",
              "That's why I like it."
            ],
            "required_patterns": ["I like", "because"],
            "required_connectors": ["because"]
          },
          "example_text": "I like drawing cartoons. I usually draw on weekends. I like it because it is creative and fun. It makes me feel relaxed. My favorite part is making funny characters. That's why I like it."
